<title>UK: Presa unit sets 200 billion lire three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Presa unit sets 200 billion lire three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager IMI Lux.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PRESINVEST</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PRESA SPA</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +50 BP    PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.52</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.75</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/GB/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.27	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
